From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zrmnelson <104142635+zrmnelson@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:41:12 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 15/17] Brand the interface as a separate product

product_name sets the application display name (and so every window title), the tray, the reset
question and the About title. The About box keeps the origin visible ("based on VLC media player by
VideoLAN", with VLC's description, authors, licence and credits) and follows the palette. Seasonal
cones are off. The application icon, preference category icons and layout previews are replaced with
artwork that carries no VLC cone; the window and tray icon come from the desktop id's theme icon.
